    "<!--\n",
    "TODO. sigma_mu = 1 fixes the scale of utility (@Ursu_Seiler_Honka_2024 §4.4.2,\n",
    "@Morozov_2021 Appendix C). The post-search standard deviation is identified in\n",
    "principle but hard to estimate in practice without a search-cost shifter\n",
    "(@Yavorsky_2021). State the consequence plainly: with both variances fixed, search\n",
    "costs cannot be monetized and search-cost counterfactuals are not interpretable\n",
    "(@Ursu_Seiler_Honka_2024 §4.4.4) -- which would rule out every friction counterfactual\n",
    "in @sec-managerial. This is why estimating it is load-bearing here rather than a\n",
    "refinement.\n",
